      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "- Be quiet. She hears everything.\n- Be careful with moving or droppable objects, making noise with them attracts Granny.\n- Hold (F) to free yourself from beartraps.\n- There are multiple weapons in the house, but not easy to get.\n- Utilize hiding spots, such as hiding under beds, tables, holes and other spots in the house.\n- To earn ingame coins, you must escape from the house. Harder difficulties give you more.\n- To have an ingame timer, make sure to press \"L\"."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 558db68fb84e79444980d6f464003440, type: 2}
